{"data":{"id":"10.21949/1404217","type":"dois","attributes":{"doi":"10.21949/1404217","prefix":"10.21949","suffix":"1404217","identifiers":[{"identifier":"FHWA-JPO-24-138","identifierType":"USDOT Report Number"}],"alternateIdentifiers":[{"alternateIdentifierType":"USDOT Report Number","alternateIdentifier":"FHWA-JPO-24-138"}],"creators":[{"name":"Hourdos, John","nameType":"Personal","givenName":"John","familyName":"Hourdos","affiliation":[],"nameIdentifiers":[]},{"name":"Federal Highway Administration","nameType":"Organizational","nameIdentifiers":[{"schemeUri":"https://ror.org/","nameIdentifier":"https://ror.org/0473rr271","nameIdentifierScheme":"ROR"}],"affiliation":[]},{"name":"University of Illinois at Urbana-Champaign","nameType":"Organizational","nameIdentifiers":[{"schemeUri":"https://ror.org/","nameIdentifier":"https://ror.org/047426m28","nameIdentifierScheme":"ROR"}],"affiliation":[]}],"titles":[{"lang":"en","title":"Third Generation Simulation Data (TGSIM) I-294 L1 Trajectories"}],"publisher":"Federal Highway Administration","container":{},"publicationYear":2024,"subjects":[{"subject":"Data","schemeUri":"https://trt.trb.org/","subjectScheme":"Transportation Research Thesaurus","classificationCode":"https://trt.trb.org/term/108531"},{"subject":"Structured data","schemeUri":"https://trt.trb.org/","subjectScheme":"Transportation Research Thesaurus","classificationCode":"https://trt.trb.org/term/108532"},{"subject":"Research","schemeUri":"https://trt.trb.org/","subjectScheme":"Transportation Research Thesaurus","classificationCode":"https://trt.trb.org/term/97412"},{"subject":"Highways","schemeUri":"https://trt.trb.org/","subjectScheme":"Transportation Research Thesaurus","classificationCode":"https://trt.trb.org/term/92827"}],"contributors":[{"name":"Federal Highway Administration: Office of Safety Research and Development","nameType":"Organizational","affiliation":["Federal Highway Administration"],"contributorType":"Sponsor","nameIdentifiers":[]},{"name":"Intelligent Transportation Systems Joint Program Office","nameType":"Organizational","contributorType":"Sponsor","nameIdentifiers":[{"schemeUri":"https://ror.org/","nameIdentifier":"https://ror.org/012cshy85","nameIdentifierScheme":"ROR"}],"affiliation":[]},{"name":"Talebpour, Alireza","nameType":"Personal","givenName":"Alireza","familyName":"Talebpour","contributorType":"Researcher","nameIdentifiers":[{"schemeUri":"https://orcid.org/","nameIdentifier":"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5412-5592","nameIdentifierScheme":"ORCID"}],"affiliation":[]},{"name":"Mahmassani, Hani S","nameType":"Personal","givenName":"Hani S","familyName":"Mahmassani","contributorType":"Researcher","affiliation":[],"nameIdentifiers":[]},{"name":"Hamdar, Samer H","nameType":"Personal","givenName":"Samer H","familyName":"Hamdar","contributorType":"Researcher","nameIdentifiers":[{"schemeUri":"https://orcid.org/","nameIdentifier":"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6896-367X","nameIdentifierScheme":"ORCID"}],"affiliation":[]},{"name":"Park, Hyungjun","nameType":"Personal","givenName":"Hyungjun","familyName":"Park","contributorType":"ContactPerson","affiliation":[],"nameIdentifiers":[]}],"dates":[{"date":"2024-11-04","dateType":"Issued"},{"date":"2025-01-24","dateType":"Updated","dateInformation":"Date cataloging record was last modified by NTL staff."},{"date":"2024-11-04","dateType":"Submitted","dateInformation":"Date cataloging record was first created in NTL cataloging system."}],"language":"en","types":{"ris":"DATA","bibtex":"misc","citeproc":"dataset","schemaOrg":"Dataset","resourceType":"Dataset","resourceTypeGeneral":"Dataset"},"relatedIdentifiers":[{"relationType":"IsPartOf","relatedIdentifier":"https://doi.org/10.21949/1530857","resourceTypeGeneral":"Collection","relatedIdentifierType":"DOI"}],"relatedItems":[],"sizes":[],"formats":["application/zip"],"version":null,"rightsList":[{"rights":"United States Government Public Domain License","rightsUri":"http://www.usa.gov/publicdomain/label/1.0/"}],"descriptions":[{"lang":"en","description":"This dataset was collected as part of the Third Generation Simulation Data (TGSIM): A Closer Look at the Impacts of Automated Driving Systems on Human Behavior project. During the project, six trajectory datasets capable of characterizing human-automated vehicle interactions under a diverse set of scenarios in highway and city environments were collected and processed. For more information, see the project report found here: https://rosap.ntl.bts.gov/view/dot/74647. This dataset, which is one of the six collected as part of the TGSIM project, contains data collected from twelve 4K stationary infrastructure cameras installed in the Foggy Bottom neighborhood of Washington, D.C. The cameras captured four intersections, adjacent crosswalks, road segments between the intersections, and partial road segments extending out from the intersections totaling more than one full block of coverage. These segments are represented by polygons to bound travel lanes, parking lanes, crosswalks, and intersections for detection and analysis purposes (see Reference_Image_Foggy Bottom.png for details). The cameras captured continuous footage during a weekday commute between 3:00PM-5:00PM ET on a sunny day. During this period, one test vehicle equipped with SAE Level 3 automation was deployed to perform various complex maneuvers at both stop signs and traffic signals, including both protected and permitted left turns, to capture human driving behaviors when interacting with automated vehicles. The automated vehicles are indicated in the dataset.","descriptionType":"TechnicalInfo"},{"lang":"en","description":"The main dataset is a 70 MB file of trajectory data (I294_L1_final.csv) that contains position, speed, and acceleration data for small and large automated (L1) vehicles and non-automated vehicles on a highway in a suburban environment. Supporting files include aerial reference images for ten distinct data collection “Runs” (I294_L1_RunX_with_lanes.png, where X equals 8, 18, and 20 for southbound runs and 1, 3, 7, 9, 11, 19, and 21 for northbound runs). Associated centerline files are also provided for each “Run” (I-294-L1-Run_X-geometry-with-ramps.csv). In each centerline file, x and y coordinates (in meters) marking each lane centerline are provided. The origin point of the reference image is located at the top left corner. Additionally, in each centerline file, an indicator variable is used for each lane to define the following types of road sections: 0=no ramp, 1=on-ramps, 2=off-ramps, and 3=weaving segments. The number attached to each column header is the numerical ID assigned for the specific lane (see “TGSIM – Centerline Data Dictionary – I294 L1.csv” for more details). The dataset defines eight lanes (four lanes in each direction) using these centerline files. Images that map the lanes of interest to the numerical lane IDs referenced in the trajectory dataset are stored in the folder titled “Annotation on Regions.zip”. The southbound lanes are shown visually in I294_L1_Lane-2.png through I294_L1_Lane-5.png and the northbound lanes are shown visually in I294_L1_Lane2.png through I294_L1_Lane5.png.","descriptionType":"Abstract"}],"geoLocations":[],"fundingReferences":[],"xml":"","url":"https://data.transportation.gov/Automobiles/Third-Generation-Simulation-Data-TGSIM-I-294-L1-Tr/7zjf-a4zf/about_data","contentUrl":null,"metadataVersion":1,"schemaVersion":"https://schema.datacite.org/meta/kernel-4.6/","source":"api","isActive":true,"state":"findable","reason":null,"viewCount":0,"viewsOverTime":[],"downloadCount":0,"downloadsOverTime":[],"referenceCount":0,"citationCount":0,"citationsOverTime":[],"partCount":0,"partOfCount":1,"versionCount":0,"versionOfCount":0,"created":"2017-10-25T14:21:47.000Z","registered":"2017-10-25T14:21:48.000Z","published":"2024","updated":"2025-08-01T14:58:14.000Z"},"relationships":{"client":{"data":{"id":"dot.dot","type":"clients"}},"provider":{"data":{"id":"dot","type":"providers"}},"media":{"data":{"id":"10.21949/1404217","type":"media"}},"references":{"data":[]},"citations":{"data":[]},"parts":{"data":[]},"partOf":{"data":[{"id":"10.21949/1530857","type":"dois"}]},"versions":{"data":[]},"versionOf":{"data":[]}}}}